    33	/// A half-open byte interval `[start, end)` with `start <= end`.
    34	///
    35	/// The endpoints are private so all publicly constructible spans uphold this
    36	/// invariant. An empty span has equal endpoints. A span need not fit a string
    37	/// or align with UTF-8 code points until it is passed to [`Self::slice`].
